<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal cuts official rates.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal cuts official rates.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal cut its repurchase rate to 6.30 percent, from 6.50 percent previously, on Friday for the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>The drain rate, the rate at which it absorbs funds, was cut to 5.80 percent from 6.20 percent while the emergency lending rate was cut to 7.80 percent from 8.30 percent.  </p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be received by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
